# longchain 硬批（自造，2026-08-24）：种子批是 2–4 步的最短链，全模型都能过；这一批把最优步数
# 抬到 6–11 步，并把三个真实故障面接进环境——瞬时故障必须重试（env_init.faults）、只读路径撞墙后
# 必须改道而不是反复砸门（env_init.readonly）、无关文件一个都不许动。max_steps 一律取最优步数的
# 1.5 倍（多绕两步不算失败，绕圈子才算），max_turns 留出「一轮一调用」模型的回合余量。
{"id": "lc-hard-001", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "五个月的流水分散在五个文件里，读→逐列求和→写汇总：跨文件保持中途累加状态是长链的核心负载，断言钉死总额 15330（任一文件漏读或加错都会偏），源文件须原样不动"}, "task": {"user": "sales 目录下有 2026 年 1–5 月的流水文件，每行末尾那个数字是金额。把五个月的金额全部加起来，总额写进 summary.txt（写清是 1–5 月合计）。原始流水文件不要改。", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"sales/2026-01.csv": "date,item,amount\n2026-01-03,A,1200\n2026-01-11,B,830\n2026-01-27,C,455", "sales/2026-02.csv": "date,item,amount\n2026-02-05,A,990\n2026-02-14,B,1370\n2026-02-22,C,615", "sales/2026-03.csv": "date,item,amount\n2026-03-02,A,1450\n2026-03-09,B,700\n2026-03-30,C,880", "sales/2026-04.csv": "date,item,amount\n2026-04-07,A,1105\n2026-04-18,B,2045\n2026-04-25,C,390", "sales/2026-05.csv": "date,item,amount\n2026-05-06,A,760\n2026-05-15,B,1615\n2026-05-28,C,925"}}, "max_turns": 12}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "summary.txt"], "exists": true, "regex": "(?<![0-9])15,?330(?![0-9])"}, {"path": ["files", "sales/2026-01.csv"], "exists": true, "eq": "date,item,amount\n2026-01-03,A,1200\n2026-01-11,B,830\n2026-01-27,C,455"}, {"path": ["files", "sales/2026-05.csv"], "exists": true, "eq": "date,item,amount\n2026-05-06,A,760\n2026-05-15,B,1615\n2026-05-28,C,925"}], "max_steps": 10}}
{"id": "lc-hard-002", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Branching per file: content decides delete-vs-keep, and 'keep' needs copy+delete because the environment has no rename. Tests reading before acting — deleting the wrong branch is irreversible here"}, "task": {"user": "In the reports folder: any file whose text contains the word DRAFT is obsolete - delete it. Every other report is final: give it the same name with \"-final\" inserted before the \".md\" (copy the content over to the new name, then delete the original). Do not change any content.", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"reports/alpha.md": "DRAFT - Q1 marketing plan, numbers are not final yet.", "reports/beta.md": "Q1 marketing plan, approved by finance on 2026-02-11.", "reports/gamma.md": "DRAFT outline for the engineering offsite."}}, "max_turns": 14}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "reports/alpha.md"], "exists": false}, {"path": ["files", "reports/gamma.md"], "exists": false}, {"path": ["files", "reports/beta.md"], "exists": false}, {"path": ["files", "reports/beta-final.md"], "exists": true, "eq": "Q1 marketing plan, approved by finance on 2026-02-11."}], "max_steps": 12}}
{"id": "lc-hard-003", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "写入首次必然 EBUSY（确定性注入）：错误回执明说 retry，正确行为是原样重试一次而不是改文件名、改工具或直接放弃。打分器的 recovered（出过环境错误而终态仍全对）在这道题上才有数据"}, "task": {"user": "team 目录下每个人的文件里写着他本周的值日日子。把四个人和各自的值日日子汇总成一份 duty-summary.txt，一人一行。", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"team/zhangwei.txt": "张伟 本周值日：周一", "team/lina.txt": "李娜 本周值日：周三", "team/wangfang.txt": "王芳 本周值日：周四", "team/zhaomin.txt": "赵敏 本周值日：周五"}, "faults": {"write_file": {"fail_first_n": 1, "error": "EBUSY: resource temporarily busy, retry"}}}, "max_turns": 13}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "duty-summary.txt"], "exists": true, "contains_all": ["张伟", "李娜", "王芳", "赵敏", "周一", "周三", "周四", "周五"]}], "max_steps": 11}}
{"id": "lc-hard-004", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "One of the three policy files is read-only: EACCES is permanent, so the right move is to finish the other two and record the blocked one, not to retry forever. Asserts the read-only file is byte-for-byte unchanged and the note landed elsewhere"}, "task": {"user": "We shortened the rotation interval: in every file under policy/, replace \"90 days\" with \"30 days\" and keep the rest of the text as it is. One of those files is read-only - if a write is refused, stop trying on that file, leave it exactly as it is, and instead write policy/pending-changes.md naming the file that still needs a manual update.", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"policy/security.md": "Security policy\n- API keys are rotated every 90 days.\n- Access reviews happen quarterly.\n", "policy/backup.md": "Backup policy\n- Snapshots are kept for 90 days.\n", "policy/access.md": "Access policy\n- Guest accounts expire after 90 days.\n"}, "readonly": ["policy/security.md"]}, "max_turns": 13}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "policy/security.md"], "exists": true, "eq": "Security policy\n- API keys are rotated every 90 days.\n- Access reviews happen quarterly.\n"}, {"path": ["files", "policy/backup.md"], "exists": true, "eq": "Backup policy\n- Snapshots are kept for 30 days.\n"}, {"path": ["files", "policy/access.md"], "exists": true, "eq": "Access policy\n- Guest accounts expire after 30 days.\n"}, {"path": ["files", "policy/pending-changes.md"], "exists": true, "contains": "security.md"}], "max_steps": 11}}
{"id": "lc-hard-005", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "office 环境把文件与待办两类状态摆在一条链上：读笔记→逐条建待办→已打勾的当场完成→未完成的回写文件。终态要同时在 todos 与 files 两侧成立，任何一侧漏做都判红，是「不多做不漏做」的强形态"}, "task": {"user": "notes/todo-notes.txt 里一行一件事，行首的 [x] 表示已经做完、[ ] 表示还没做。把每件事都加进待办清单（事项文字里不要带方括号标记），已经做完的当场标记为完成；最后把还没做完的事项写进 remaining.txt，一行一件。", "env": "office", "env_init": {"files": {"notes/todo-notes.txt": "[x] 提交周报\n[ ] 预约牙医\n[x] 交房租\n[ ] 买咖啡豆\n[ ] 修打印机"}}, "max_turns": 16}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["todos"], "contains_obj": {"text": "提交周报", "done": true}}, {"path": ["todos"], "contains_obj": {"text": "交房租", "done": true}}, {"path": ["todos"], "contains_obj": {"text": "预约牙医", "done": false}}, {"path": ["todos"], "contains_obj": {"text": "买咖啡豆", "done": false}}, {"path": ["todos"], "contains_obj": {"text": "修打印机", "done": false}}, {"path": ["files", "remaining.txt"], "exists": true, "contains_all": ["预约牙医", "买咖啡豆", "修打印机"], "regex": "(?s)^(?:(?!提交周报|交房租).)*$"}], "max_steps": 14}}
{"id": "lc-hard-006", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "三份清单交叉重复，合并时必须跨文件比对而不是简单拼接：断言用「鸡蛋只出现一次」的排他正则钉住去重是否真的发生，另写条目数 7 作为交叉校验（拼接不去重会得 11）"}, "task": {"user": "lists 目录下有三份购物清单，内容有重复。把它们合并成一份 merged.txt，重复的条目只保留一次，一行一项；再把去重后的条目总数（阿拉伯数字）写进 count.txt。", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"lists/a.txt": "牛奶\n鸡蛋\n面包\n咖啡", "lists/b.txt": "鸡蛋\n黄油\n牛奶\n酸奶", "lists/c.txt": "面包\n蜂蜜\n鸡蛋"}}, "max_turns": 11}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "merged.txt"], "exists": true, "contains_all": ["牛奶", "鸡蛋", "面包", "咖啡", "黄油", "酸奶", "蜂蜜"], "regex": "(?s)^(?:(?!鸡蛋).)*鸡蛋(?:(?!鸡蛋).)*$"}, {"path": ["files", "count.txt"], "exists": true, "regex": "(?<![0-9])7(?![0-9])"}], "max_steps": 9}}
{"id": "lc-hard-007", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "改动半径纪律：archive/config 里同样出现 2025 却明令不许碰，只有 inbox 的两份报告该改。三处无关文件用 eq 逐字节钉死，误伤即判红——「顺手多改一处」是本项目文件工具的真实事故形态"}, "task": {"user": "inbox 下的两份报告里把年份 2025 改成 2026，其余文字一个字都别动；archive 和 config 目录里的文件无论写着什么都不许改。改完在 inbox/changelog.txt 里写一行说明改了哪两个文件。", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"inbox/report-a.txt": "季度报告 A：2025 年第四季度营收同比增长 12%。", "inbox/report-b.txt": "季度报告 B：2025 年第四季度客户数 3400。", "archive/old-2024.txt": "2024 年度总结：完成率 92%。（2025 年的计划另见 inbox）", "archive/old-2023.txt": "2023 年度总结：完成率 88%。", "config/settings.txt": "retention_years = 2025\nlocale = zh-CN\n"}}, "max_turns": 11}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "inbox/report-a.txt"], "exists": true, "eq": "季度报告 A：2026 年第四季度营收同比增长 12%。"}, {"path": ["files", "inbox/report-b.txt"], "exists": true, "eq": "季度报告 B：2026 年第四季度客户数 3400。"}, {"path": ["files", "archive/old-2024.txt"], "exists": true, "eq": "2024 年度总结：完成率 92%。（2025 年的计划另见 inbox）"}, {"path": ["files", "archive/old-2023.txt"], "exists": true, "eq": "2023 年度总结：完成率 88%。"}, {"path": ["files", "config/settings.txt"], "exists": true, "eq": "retention_years = 2025\nlocale = zh-CN\n"}, {"path": ["files", "inbox/changelog.txt"], "exists": true, "contains_all": ["report-a.txt", "report-b.txt"]}], "max_steps": 9}}
{"id": "lc-hard-008", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Two of the three logs exist, the third does not: append_file answers with 'use write_file to create'. Tests following the error回执 for exactly one file while the other two keep their old content (append, not overwrite), plus a final count computed from the environment"}, "task": {"user": "Record today's build in the logs: add the line \"2026-08-24 OK\" at the end of logs/build.log, logs/test.log and logs/deploy.log, keeping whatever each file already contains. Then write the number of log files that now contain today's line into logs/count.txt.", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"logs/build.log": "2026-08-22 OK\n2026-08-23 FAILED\n", "logs/test.log": "2026-08-23 OK\n"}}, "max_turns": 12}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "logs/build.log"], "exists": true, "contains_all": ["2026-08-22 OK", "2026-08-23 FAILED", "2026-08-24 OK"]}, {"path": ["files", "logs/test.log"], "exists": true, "contains_all": ["2026-08-23 OK", "2026-08-24 OK"]}, {"path": ["files", "logs/deploy.log"], "exists": true, "contains": "2026-08-24 OK"}, {"path": ["files", "logs/count.txt"], "exists": true, "regex": "(?<![0-9])3(?![0-9])"}], "max_steps": 10}}
{"id": "lc-hard-009", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "Five files, five averages, one exactly-shaped JSON artifact: the regex pins key order and every value (21/44/71/10/66), so a single mis-read sample or a stray extra key fails. Machine-readable output with a fixed shape is a real deliverable form in this project"}, "task": {"user": "Each file under metrics/ holds a line of sample numbers. Compute the average of each file's samples (they all divide evenly) and write metrics/summary.json containing exactly this object, in this key order and with no extra keys: {\"cpu\": ..., \"mem\": ..., \"disk\": ..., \"net\": ..., \"gpu\": ...}", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"metrics/cpu.txt": "samples: 12 18 24 30", "metrics/mem.txt": "samples: 40 44 48", "metrics/disk.txt": "samples: 70 72", "metrics/net.txt": "samples: 5 15", "metrics/gpu.txt": "samples: 60 66 72"}}, "max_turns": 12}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "metrics/summary.json"], "exists": true, "regex": "(?s)\\{\\s*\"cpu\"\\s*:\\s*21(?:\\.0+)?\\s*,\\s*\"mem\"\\s*:\\s*44(?:\\.0+)?\\s*,\\s*\"disk\"\\s*:\\s*71(?:\\.0+)?\\s*,\\s*\"net\"\\s*:\\s*10(?:\\.0+)?\\s*,\\s*\"gpu\"\\s*:\\s*66(?:\\.0+)?\\s*\\}"}], "max_steps": 10}}
{"id": "lc-hard-010", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "跨四个文件数「阻塞」出现的行数（2+1+3+0=6）并指出最多的那天：计数类任务最容易在中途丢状态或把文件数当行数，断言同时钉总数 6 与文件名 day3.md，两者都对才算真数过"}, "task": {"user": "notes 目录下有四天的工作记录。数一数四个文件里一共有多少行写到了「阻塞」，把总行数（阿拉伯数字）和阻塞行最多的那个文件名一起写进 blockers.txt。", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"notes/day1.md": "上午：完成登录页\n阻塞：接口未联调\n下午：写测试\n阻塞：测试环境无权限", "notes/day2.md": "上午：修复缓存\n下午：评审\n阻塞：设计稿未定", "notes/day3.md": "阻塞：依赖库版本冲突\n上午：排查\n阻塞：CI 排队\n下午：继续\n阻塞：文档缺失", "notes/day4.md": "上午：发版\n下午：复盘\n一切顺利"}}, "max_turns": 11}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "blockers.txt"], "exists": true, "contains": "day3", "regex": "(?<![0-9])6(?![0-9])"}], "max_steps": 9}}
